# Kandelo patch rationale (S30)
# Judgment: Mixed. Promise events are needed; changes to creation and
# optimization require separate event-by-event evidence.
#
# Node async_hooks needs Promise creation, resolution and callback events
# with the correct parent and resource identities. Stock interfaces
# inspected so far do not expose that complete sequence. Keep generic event
# hooks with Node IDs and bookkeeping in the bridge; the OS cannot observe
# Promise events. This patch also changes Promise creation/optimization
# paths, which require separate justification rather than blanket
# acceptance as mere notifications.
#
# Retained provisionally; see README.md: Future work: platform omissions.

